From 8f09f67e52a063f09fff6282f4ef79f5d65b1089 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kethan Surana <ckethan1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 05:23:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test: take the suite off cdn.skypack.dev

cdn.skypack.dev now serves broken module shapes for some packages
('signal is not a function' for @preact/signals-core and usignal), and solid-js
resolved under node pulls its server build where createEffect is a no-op. The
libraries move to devDependencies and the solid test pins the client build
(solid-js/dist/solid.js). The suite no longer needs the https loader.

39 assertions, all green, fully offline.
